**My Library** is your own library account. It is off for teachers until your school ticks
**My loans & holds** for the teacher role in Access Control. A non-teaching staff member sees it
once an administrator has [given them app access](/docs/educonnect-library-borrowers).

It shows:

- Books you have on loan and when they are due.
- Your holds. Use **Reserve a book** to search the catalogue and reserve one that is out (if holds
  are on and you are under your limit), and cancel your own holds.
- Fines to view. Teachers and staff are never fined.
- Books you have returned.

Renewals and returns happen at the desk. If you see a message that your account has no library
record, ask the librarian to add you as a borrower.
